1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,600
To increase the likelihood of success, one should set realistic goals and work persistently towards them.
要提高成功的可能性，一个人应当设定切合实际的目标，并坚持不懈地朝着目标努力。

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:17,510
Many people fail not because they lack ability, but because their goals are either unrealistic or abandoned halfway.
许多人失败，不是因为缺乏能力，而是因为他们的目标要么不切实际，要么半途而废。

3
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:22,760
A realistic goal is one that matches our abilities and circumstances.
切合实际的目标就是与我们的能力和处境相符的目标。

4
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:31,400
If a goal is set too high, repeated failure may soon destroy our confidence; if it is too low, it offers little motivation.
如果目标定得太高，接连的失败可能很快就会摧毁我们的自信；如果定得太低，它又几乎起不到激励作用。

5
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:42,550
A student preparing for CET-6, for example, would do better to set a target of learning twenty new words a day than to try to memorize a whole dictionary in a month.
例如，一个备考六级的学生，与其试图在一个月内背下整本词典，不如定下每天学二十个新单词的目标。

6
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:46,010
However, a sensible goal alone is not enough.
然而，光有合理的目标是不够的。

7
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:51,620
Success also depends on persistent effort, especially when progress seems slow.
成功还取决于坚持不懈的努力，尤其是在进展似乎很慢的时候。

8
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:59,280
Just as dripping water wears away a stone, small steps taken every day eventually add up to great achievements.
正如滴水能把石头磨穿，每天迈出的一小步最终会积累成巨大的成就。

9
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:06,570
Therefore, we should first assess our strengths and weaknesses honestly and set goals that are challenging but achievable.
因此，我们应该首先诚实地评估自己的优点和缺点，并设定有挑战性却又能实现的目标。

10
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:13,930
Then we must stick to our plans day after day, adjusting our methods when necessary but never giving up easily.
然后，我们必须日复一日地坚持自己的计划，必要时调整方法，但绝不轻易放弃。

11
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:21,270
Realistic goals combined with persistent effort will greatly increase our chances of success in any field.
切合实际的目标加上坚持不懈的努力，将大大提高我们在任何领域取得成功的机会。
